SUMMARY:Planning commission hearing and recommendation: Kessler Road batter
 y project rezoning\, Wrenfield Township (RZ-26-014)
DESCRIPTION:Northbank Storage Partners LLC asks to rezone about 48.2 acres 
 on the north side of Kessler Road from A-1 Agricultural to I-1 Light Indus
 trial for a battery energy storage facility of about 80 MW / 320 MWh\, as 
 stated in the application (case RZ-26-014).\n\nSource: Kestrel Regional Pl
 anning Commission\, agenda for October 22\, 2026 (PDF)\, page 1\, item 3a\
 ; case summary on page 2\nhttps://www.kestrelrpc.example/agendas/current-a
 genda.pdf\n\nFrom Battery Storage Zoning Watch\, Week 41 (Fieldline Briefs
 ). Check the official source before you rely on this date. Not legal advic
 e.
URL:https://www.kestrelrpc.example/agendas/current-agenda.pdf
CATEGORIES:Rezonings and applications
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:RPC Meeting Room\, 210 Pike Street\, Tarrow City
